WEBVTT

00:02:55.534 --> 00:03:00.955
of truly groundbreaking technologies
that impact every part of our lives,

00:03:00.979 --> 00:03:04.789
and artificial intelligence
is a technology

00:03:04.813 --> 00:03:08.941
that can learn to make
very accurate decisions,

00:03:08.965 --> 00:03:12.093
predictions, classifications

00:03:12.117 --> 00:03:15.434
purely based on seeing a lot of data.

00:03:15.458 --> 00:03:21.747
So that kind of capability
will bring us amazing efficiency,

00:03:21.771 --> 00:03:24.611
greater profits, cost savings,

00:03:24.635 --> 00:03:28.524
and also liberate us
from a lot of routine jobs.

00:03:28.548 --> 00:03:32.519
And it impacts
every imaginable profession.